From aa4cee5eb09ece7dfebb4cd12ffe05363423fad6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:31:41 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 40/59] XvT friendly/enemy craft lists (F, Shift+F); shorter
 messages

- F and Shift+F open X-Wing vs TIE Fighter's friendly and enemy craft lists
  (Mfd_DrawCraftListPage), scrolled with Up and Down. The friendly list puts
  the player's flight group first, then the other friendly groups; the
  enemy list adds XvT's Orders column from the flight group's goal while it
  is still to do (Destroy, Inspect, Capture, Board). Rows show the name as
  XvT's 9 characters, SHD/HULL coloured by health and the craft's target.
  Drawn in XvT's MICRO64 font in its 225x94 box at (415, 296), filled in the
  cockpit and see-through with it off. The lists need the targeting
  computer. Actions info_friendly_craft, info_enemy_craft, info_scroll_up,
  info_scroll_down (keys 235-238).
- S-foils move to V, as in XvT and XWA; the film viewer moves to Shift+V.
- game.short_messages ("Message Time"): messages stay up half as long, never
  less than 1.5 s.
